      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a 350 km relocation from Gomti to a major hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For a 350 km relocation, you’ll need a valid government‑issued ID (Aadhaar or PAN), the original GST invoice of the moving company, a signed packing list, and a copy of the e‑Way bill for the cargo. If the move is corporate‑backed, the employer’s authorization letter is also required. These documents ensure smooth check‑post clearance and insurance processing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 100% insurance coverage work for high‑value items?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 100% insurance offered by Packers And Movers In Gomti is IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. You declare the market value of each high‑value item, and the insurer provides coverage up to that amount for loss, theft, or damage during transit. The premium is calculated as a small percentage of the declared value and is added to the final invoice.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges in the cost matrix for Packers And Movers In Gomti?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden fees are applied. The cost matrix clearly lists the base fare, distance surcharge, packing material costs, insurance premium, and any optional services such as disassembly or special handling. Any additional charge, like a last‑minute change in destination or extra weight, is communicated upfront before the move begins.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the company ensure safety of appliances and furniture during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Safety is ensured through a combination of the 7‑layer protective packaging system, custom‑fit wooden crates for fragile items, and hydraulic loading ramps that minimize impact. Trained technicians handle disassembly and reassembly, while GPS‑tracked multi‑axle trucks maintain stable temperature and vibration levels, guaranteeing that appliances and furniture arrive intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical delivery time for a shipment from Gomti to a destination 850 km away?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, Packers And Movers In Gomti completes the 850 km journey within 24‑30 hours. The timeline includes loading, transit across national highways, mandatory check‑post inspections, and unloading at the destination hub. Real‑time GPS tracking allows customers to monitor progress and receive updates on any delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time during the Gomti to hub transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every truck in the Packers And Movers In Gomti fleet is equipped with satellite GPS devices. Once your shipment is loaded, you receive a unique tracking ID. Using the company’s online portal or mobile app, you can view live location, estimated arrival time, and receive instant alerts for any route deviations.</p>
